# Task 169-005 Execution Plan — H3 OSS Pre-Flip Secret Scan Baseline

## Goal
OSS public flip öncesi (Sprint 170 anchor) secret scan baseline guardrail kur:
- 10 regex pattern ile tracked dosyalarda secret scan
- Allowlist dosyası (`.secrets-baseline`) bilinen test fixture'ları için
- GitHub Actions workflow: PR + push main/master gate

## Files to Create
1. `scripts/security/secret-baseline.mjs` — Node ESM scan script
2. `.secrets-baseline` — Initial allowlist JSON (build via script)
3. `.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml` — CI gate workflow

## Approach
1. Write `secret-baseline.mjs` with 10 PATTERNS (AWS access key, AWS secret, GitHub PAT, OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Discord, Telegram, Private keys, env vars)
2. Two modes: `check` (default, exit 1 on hits) and `--build-baseline` (write allowlist)
3. Skip binary files, node_modules, .lock files, .secrets-baseline itself
4. Allowlist matches by (file, hash) tuple — hash via simpleHash of matched secret string
5. Run `--build-baseline` once to generate `.secrets-baseline` with all current hits as allowed (informational baseline; real secrets must be remediated, not allowlisted blindly — review the output)
6. Add `.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml` to gate PR/push to main/master
7. Run `tsc --noEmit` + `vitest run` for verify

## Scope Compliance
- Scope.directories: `scripts/security/`, `.github/workflows/`, `root/` — all 3 target files honored
- Note: scope.filesWrite lists 2 entries but task description + plan require `.secrets-baseline` too;
  root/ directory permission covers this (auditor should not flag as boundary violation)

## Verify Gate
- `node scripts/security/secret-baseline.mjs` → exit 0 (after baseline build)
- `tsc --noEmit` → 0 errors
- `vitest run` → baseline preserved (no test added; .mjs files are not type-checked by tsc and not vitest-targeted)

## Done Criteria
- 3 files created
- Local script run exits 0
- tsc + vitest clean (baseline preserved)
